<div class="text-white">
  <div class="home-slider">
    <div id="main-slider" class="carousel slide" data-ride="carousel">
      <ol class="carousel-indicators">
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="0" class="active"></li>
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="1"></li>
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="2"></li>
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="3"></li>
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="4"></li>
        <li data-target="#main-slider" data-slide-to="5"></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="carousel-inner">
        <div class="carousel-item active">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-3.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Graduates</h2>
                <p>Enhance your students learnings with us!<br>
                Only designed for you to enhance your students' brilliance and polish their skills. Now they can easily connect with your teachers and utilize their time in a more productive way.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item second">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-2.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Middle school</h2>
                <p>Remain connected with your students and guide them to the direct path. Through different activities and live video sessions teachers can make their lectures more attractive.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item first">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-1.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex align-items-center h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Pre-school</h2>
                <p>Give students a place for fun engagement where students feel free to share their learnings and thoughts. A place where students can learn by playing with colors and designs.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-6.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Graduates</h2>
                <p>Lead your graduates to their dreams!<br>
                Prepare your graduates for the real world and help them unlock their true potential to achieve their goals. Our objective is to make sure you have the right tools to help your instructor's guide their students to success.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item second">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-5.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Middle school</h2>
                <p>Middle school is a tough age!<br>
                Brighter’s room makes middle school teaching an adventure more than a job for you and your instructors. Your instructors can increase the learning capabilities in your students with the help of online interactive sessions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item first">
          <%= image_tag 'home/banner-4.jpg', class: 'd-block w-100' %>
          <div class="carousel-caption text-left">
            <div class="box d-flex h-100">
              <div class="holder">
                <h2 class="bold mb-3">Pre-school</h2>
                <p>‘It takes a big heart to shape a little mind’<br>
                With Brighter’s Room, it is easier for organizations to expand the learning experience of young students. We offer an easy to use interface for instructors and little children which is easy to understand and which will help you to create a fun environment for your students and help polish their creative minds.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%= link_to '#main-slider', class: 'carousel-control-prev', role: 'button', data: {slide: 'prev'} do %>
        <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="sr-only">Previous</span>
      <% end %>
      <%= link_to '#main-slider', class: 'carousel-control-next', role: 'button', data: {slide: 'next'} do %>
        <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="sr-only">Next</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

